        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Songs: \"Slow Turning\", \"Drive South\"\n- Albums: Slow Turning, The Way It Feels\n- Films: The Rookie\n- People: John Hiatt, Dennis Quaid, John Lee Hancock, Colin Linden, Bruce Cockburn\n- Companies: Walt Disney Pictures\n- Groups: Fairfield Four, Memphis Horns\n\nFacts:\n- In 1988, John Hiatt recorded the song \"Drive South\" on his album Slow Turning.\n- In 2002, the single \"Slow Turning\" was featured in the motion picture drama The Rookie.\n- In 2002, Dennis Quaid starred in The Rookie.\n- In 2002, John Lee Hancock directed The Rookie.\n- In 2002, Walt Disney Pictures produced The Rookie.\n- The CD The Way It Feels included contributions from Colin Linden, John Hiatt, Bruce Cockburn, the Fairfield Four, and the Memphis Horns.",
